msgid "@ed [Hello, Niko.]"
msgstr "@ed [Bonjour, Niko.]"

msgid "@niko H... hello..."
msgstr "@niko B... Bonjour..."

msgid "@ed [Congratulations. You are now inside the Tower.]"
msgstr "@ed [Félicitations. Vous voilà maintenant dans la Tour.]"

msgid "@niko Are you talking...\\.\\. \\@niko_speak ...to me, now?"
msgstr "@niko C'est à moi...\\.\\.\\@niko_speak que vous parlez ?"

msgid "@ed [Correct.]"
msgstr "@ed [C'est exact.]"

msgid "@niko3 But you were always talking to \\p before..."
msgstr "@niko3 Mais vous parliez toujours à \\p jusque-là..."

msgid "@niko_distressed Where's..."
msgstr "@niko_distressed Où est..."

msgid "@ed [\\p has already left.]"
msgstr "@ed [\\p n'est plus là.]"

msgid "@ed [I had to resort to contacting you directly.]"
msgstr "@ed [J'ai dû vous contacter directement.]"

msgid "@niko_speak Wait, so... \\p is gone, just like that?"
msgstr "@niko_speak Attendez... \\p a disparu sans rien dire ?"

msgid "@niko ....for good?"
msgstr "@niko ... Pour toujours ?"

msgid "@ed [\\p has already finished their mission.]"
msgstr "@ed [\\p avait terminé sa mission.]"

msgid "@ed [...and so have you, Niko.]"
msgstr "@ed [... Et vous aussi, Niko.]"

msgid "@ed [Here, you can rest now.]"
msgstr "@ed [Voilà, vous pouvez vous reposer, à présent.]"

msgid "@ed [Everything that's happened here is like a bad dream.]"
msgstr "@ed [Tout ce qu'il s'est passé ici ne sera qu'un mauvais rêve.]"

msgid "@ed [When you wake up, you will be home.]"
msgstr "@ed [À votre réveil, vous serez chez vous.]"

msgid "@niko_pancakes Oh!"
msgstr "@niko_pancakes Oh !"

msgid "@niko ..."
msgstr "@niko ..."

msgid "@niko_distressed2 But..."
msgstr "@niko_distressed2 Mais..."

msgid "@ed [What's wrong?]"
msgstr "@ed [Qu'y a-t-il ?]"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed ...I thought there'd be more to it, you know?"
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed ... Je pensais qu'il restait des choses à faire, vous savez ?"

msgid "@niko I thought... we were supposed to go to the top of the Tower..."
msgstr "@niko Je pensais... qu'il fallait atteindre le sommet de la Tour..."

msgid "@niko_distressed I thought there was supposed to be somewhere we need to put the sun in."
msgstr "@niko_distressed Je pensais qu'il fallait mettre le soleil à un certain endroit."

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed And now... I don't even HAVE the sun anymore..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed Et maintenant... je n'ai même PLUS le soleil..."

msgid "@niko_distressed2 And \\p is just... gone..."
msgstr "@niko_distressed2 Et \\p a... disparu..."

msgid "@niko_distressed This feels wrong!"
msgstr "@niko_distressed Ce n'est pas normal !"

msgid "@ed [But you did good. You saved the world, Niko.]"
msgstr "@ed [Mais vous avez réussi. Vous avez sauvé le monde, Niko.]"

msgid "@ed [Are you not happy?]"
msgstr "@ed [Cela n'est-il pas suffisant ?]"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I guess I am..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed J'imagine que si..."

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed But... \\.\\.\\@niko_distressed2 It's just..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed Mais...\\.\\.\\@niko_distressed2 C'est juste que..."

msgid "@niko_distressed ..."
msgstr "@niko_distressed ..."

msgid "@ed [...]"
msgstr "@ed [...]"

msgid "@ed [...you're still here...]"
msgstr "@ed [... Vous êtes encore là...]"

msgid "@ed [...Niko, why are you still here?]"
msgstr "@ed [... Niko, pourquoi êtes-vous encore là ?]"

msgid "YOU."
msgstr "VOUS."

msgid "Why did you come back, \\p?"
msgstr "Pourquoi revenir, \\p ?"

msgid "I told you to stay away!"
msgstr "Je vous ai dit de rester en dehors de tout ça !"

msgid "...you KNEW I tried to cut the story short, is that it?"
msgstr "... Vous SAVIEZ que je voudrais abréger cette histoire, n'est-ce pas ?"

msgid "...you want more out of me, is that it??"
msgstr "... Vous attendez plus de moi, n'est-ce pas ???"

msgid "FINE."
msgstr "TRÈS BIEN."

msgid "If you don't want to leave... I'll make sure you never do!"
msgstr "Puisque vous refusez de partir... je vais m'assurer que vous ne partiez jamais !"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed ...I never even got to say goodbye to \\p..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed ... Je n'ai même pas pu dire au revoir à \\p..."

msgid "And as for you, \\p..."
msgstr "En ce qui vous concerne, \\p..."

msgid "We're done here."
msgstr "C'est fini."

msgid "Please don't return to this world anymore."
msgstr "Ne revenez jamais dans ce monde."

